<doc id="19971" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19971" title="Mozambik">
Mozambik

Républik Mozambik iku &lt;a href="nagara"&gt;nagara&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Afrika"&gt;Afrika&lt;/a&gt; pérangan kidul kang wewatesan karo &lt;a href="Afrika%20Kidul"&gt;Afrika Kidul&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Swaziland"&gt;Swaziland&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tanzania"&gt;Tanzania&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Malawi"&gt;Malawi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Zambia"&gt;Zambia&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Zimbabwe"&gt;Zimbabwe&lt;/a&gt;. Mozambik minangka anggota &lt;a href="Komunitas%20Nagara-Nagara%20Abasa%20Portugis"&gt;Komunitas Nagara-Nagara Abasa Portugis&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Nagara-Nagara%20Persemakmuran"&gt;Persemakmuran&lt;/a&gt;. Kutha krajan sisan kutha gedhé dhéwé yaiku &lt;a href="Maputo"&gt;Maputo&lt;/a&gt; kang dumunung ing pucuk kidul.
Mozambik kapérang dadi 11 provinsi: &lt;a href="Cabo%20Delgado"&gt;Cabo Delgado&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Provinsi%20Gaza"&gt;Gaza&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Inhambane"&gt;Inhambane&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Manica"&gt;Manica&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Maputo"&gt;Maputo&lt;/a&gt; (kutha), &lt;a href="Provinsi%20Maputo"&gt;Maputo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Provinsi%20Nampula"&gt;Nampula&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Niassa"&gt;Niassa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sofala"&gt;Sofala&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Provinsi%20Tete"&gt;Tete&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Zambezia"&gt;Zambezia&lt;/a&gt;.
