Sisilia kaloka minangka panggonan seni: akèh juru gurit lan juru nulis dilairaké ing tlatah iki, antarané &lt;a href="Luigi%20Pirandello"&gt;Luigi Pirandello&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Giovanni%20Verga"&gt;Giovanni Verga&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Salvatore%20Quasimodo"&gt;Salvatore Quasimodo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Gesualdo%20Bufalino"&gt;Gesualdo Bufalino&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Ignazio%20Buttitta"&gt;Ignazio Buttitta&lt;/a&gt;.
