<doc id="20253" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20253" title="Sardinia">
Sardinia

Sardinia (&lt;a href="basa%20Italia"&gt;basa Italia&lt;/a&gt;: Sardegna, &lt;a href="basa%20Sardinia"&gt;basa Sardinia&lt;/a&gt;: Sardigna, Sardinna utawa Sardinnia) iku &lt;a href="pulo"&gt;pulo&lt;/a&gt; gedhé dhéwé kaloro sawisé &lt;a href="Sisilia"&gt;Sisilia&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Sagara%20Tengah"&gt;Sagara Tengah&lt;/a&gt;. Sardinia dumunung antarané &lt;a href="Italia"&gt;Italia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sepanyol"&gt;Sepanyol&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Tunisia"&gt;Tunisia&lt;/a&gt;, ing sisih kidul Pulo &lt;a href="Korsika"&gt;Korsika&lt;/a&gt;. Sardinia nduwé status &lt;a href="Regione%20Italia"&gt;regioni&lt;/a&gt; otonomi &lt;a href="Italia"&gt;Italia&lt;/a&gt;. Kutha krajané yaiku &lt;a href="Cagliari"&gt;Cagliari&lt;/a&gt;. Sardinia jembaré 24.090&amp;nbsp;km² kanthi populasi 1.650.000 jiwa.
Region iki kapérang dadi 8 provinsi: &lt;a href="Cagliari"&gt;Cagliari&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sassari"&gt;Sassari&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Nuoro"&gt;Nuoro&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Oristano"&gt;Oristano&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Olbia-Tempio"&gt;Olbia-Tempio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ogliastra"&gt;Ogliastra&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Carbonia-Iglesias"&gt;Carbonia-Iglesias&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Medio%20Campidano"&gt;Medio Campidano&lt;/a&gt;.
