Ora mung &lt;a href="kutha"&gt;kutha&lt;/a&gt; Cremona, nanging uga tlatah saubengé, misuwur bab panganan, kaya ta &lt;a href="%27%27nougat%27%27"&gt;nougat&lt;/a&gt; (It. torrone) lan mustard.
