Sisih lor-wétan saka departemen iki, yaiku ing &lt;a href="Pays%20de%20Gex"&gt;Pays de Gex&lt;/a&gt; nduwé akèh &lt;a href="ski%20resort"&gt;ski resort&lt;/a&gt; lan pemandhangan alam &lt;a href="Alpen"&gt;Alpen&lt;/a&gt;, kalebu uga &lt;a href="Mont%20Blanc"&gt;Mont Blanc&lt;/a&gt;.
