Makedonia Tengah (&lt;a href="basa%20Yunani"&gt;basa Yunani&lt;/a&gt;: Περιφέρεια Κεντρικής Μακεδονίας, Periféria Kentrikís Makedonías) iku siji saka telulas &lt;a href="periphery%20ing%20Yunani"&gt;periphery ing Yunani&lt;/a&gt;, minangka pérangan tengah saka &lt;a href="Makedonia%20%28Yunani%29"&gt;Makedonia Yunani&lt;/a&gt;. Periphery iki kapérang dadi &lt;a href="Prefecture%20ing%20Yunani"&gt;prefecture&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Chalkidiki"&gt;Chalkidiki&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Prefecture%20Imathia"&gt;Imathia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Prefecture%20Kilkis"&gt;Kilkis&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Prefecture%20Pella"&gt;Pella&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pieria"&gt;Pieria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Prefecture%20Serres"&gt;Serres&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Prefecture%20Thessalopunika"&gt;Thessalopunika&lt;/a&gt;. Cacahing sing ndunungi watara 2 yuta jiwa, nomer loro ing Yunani.
