Kuomintang utawa Parté Nasionalis China (&lt;a href="Hanzi"&gt;Hanzi&lt;/a&gt;: 中國國民黨; &lt;a href="hanyu%20pinyin"&gt;hanyu pinyin&lt;/a&gt;: zhongguo guomindang) iku &lt;a href="part%C3%A9%20pulitik"&gt;parté pulitik&lt;/a&gt; kang tuwa dhéwé sajeroning sajarah modern &lt;a href="Tiongkok"&gt;Tiongkok&lt;/a&gt;. Parté diyasa déning &lt;a href="Sun%20Yat-sen"&gt;Sun Yat-sen&lt;/a&gt; mawa tujuan révolusi nglawan &lt;a href="kamaharajan%20Qing"&gt;kamaharajan Qing&lt;/a&gt; lan ngadegaké Républik China minangka panganyaran ing Tiongkok.
