Rukun Iman 
Rukun Iman (&lt;a href="basa%20Arab"&gt;basa Arab&lt;/a&gt;: أركان الإيمان, translit. arkān al-īmān‎) yaiku rukun-rukun kang kudu diimani wong &lt;a href="Islam"&gt;Islam&lt;/a&gt; kabèh.
<h2>Isine Rukun Iman</h2>
Isine Rukun Iman.
Rukun Iman iku miturut ilèn Islam Sunni dumadi saka:
<ul>
<li>Iman marang &lt;a href="Allah"&gt;Allah&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<ul>
<li>Nyekseni yen &lt;a href="Allah"&gt;Allah&lt;/a&gt; iku ana</li>
<li>Patuh lan tangat marang Ajaran Allah lan Hukum-hukumÉ</li>
</ul>
<li>Iman marang anané &lt;a href="Mala%C3%A9kat"&gt;Malaékat&lt;/a&gt;-malaékat Allah</li>
<ul>
<li>Weruh lan percaya marang kakuwasan lan kaagungan Allah ing alam semesta</li>
</ul>
<li>Iman marang Kitab-kitab Allah</li>
<ul>
<li>Nglakoni ajaran Allah sajeroning kitab-kitabÉ kanthi hanif. Salah siji kitab Allah yaiku &lt;a href="Kuran"&gt;Kuran&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>Kuran ngamot telu kitab Allah sadurungé, yaiku kitab-kitab &lt;a href="Zabur"&gt;Zabur&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tor%C3%A8t"&gt;Torèt&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Injil"&gt;Injil&lt;/a&gt;</li>
</ul>
<li>Iman marang Rasul-rasul Allah</li>
<ul>
<li>Nyonto perjuangan para &lt;a href="Nabi"&gt;Nabi&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Rasul"&gt;Rasul&lt;/a&gt; sajeroning nyebaraké lan ngalkoni kebenaran kang dikanthèni kasabaran</li>
</ul>
<li>Iman marang dina &lt;a href="Akhirat"&gt;Akhirat&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<ul>
<li>Paham yèn saben lelaku bakal ana ganjarané</li>
</ul>
<li>Iman marang &lt;a href="Qada"&gt;Qada&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Qadar"&gt;Qadar&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<ul>
<li>Paham marang kaputusan sarta kapastian kang ditemtokaké déning Allah.</li>
</ul>
</ul>
Rukun Iman miturut ilèn Islam Singah dumadi saka:
<ul>
<li>at-tauhid</li>
<li>an-nubuwah</li>
<li>al-imamah</li>
<li>al-adhl</li>
</ul>
