<doc id="21097" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21097" title="Bobby Fischer">
Bobby Fischer

Robert James "Bobby" Fischer (&lt;a href="Chicago"&gt;Chicago&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Illinois"&gt;Illinois&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sarekat"&gt;AS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="9%20Maret"&gt;9 Maret&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1943"&gt;1943&lt;/a&gt; – &lt;a href="Reykjavik"&gt;Reykjavik&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="%C3%88slan"&gt;Èslan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="18%20Januari"&gt;18 Januari&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2008"&gt;2008&lt;/a&gt;) iku sawijining juru main catur misuwur Amérikah Sarékat siji-sijiné sing naté menang Patandhingan Catur Donya resmi ing taun 1972 sing dianakaké ing &lt;a href="Reykjavik"&gt;Reykjavik&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="%C3%88slan"&gt;Èslan&lt;/a&gt; nglawan &lt;a href="Boris%20Spassky"&gt;Boris Spassky&lt;/a&gt; sing asalé saka &lt;a href="Uni%20Sovy%C3%A8t"&gt;Uni Sovyèt&lt;/a&gt;. Kamenangan Bobby Fischer iku kala iku dianggep kamenangan simbolis &lt;a href="kapitalisme"&gt;kapitalisme&lt;/a&gt; marang &lt;a href="kuminisme"&gt;kuminisme&lt;/a&gt;.
Nanging ing taun-taun sabanjuré, Bobby Fischer dadi radikal lan ndarbèni paham &lt;a href="anti-Am%C3%A9rikanisme"&gt;anti-Amérikanisme&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="anti-imperialisme"&gt;anti-imperialisme&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="anti-Seminisme"&gt;anti-Seminisme&lt;/a&gt;. Ing taun-taun pungkasan uripé, dhèwèké manggon ing &lt;a href="%C3%88slan"&gt;Èslan&lt;/a&gt;.
